codex
Rejected on Track B under G9(b).

The paper’s reach computation is polynomial-time, while NP-hardness applies specifically to maximum-area packing via Planar-Monotone-3SAT—not this generated distribution. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.09562)

At the final preset:

- Bare oracle arm: 0/3 solved.
- Structurally hinted arm: 1/3 solved.
- Mechanical scan: 21,600,072 operations, about 0.67 seconds.
- Compact route: at most 240 operations.
- G1–G8 pass; G9(b) fails after the single permitted escalation.

Artifacts:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1806.09562/REJECTED.md)
- [Retained generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1806.09562/rejected_gen_1806_09562.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1806.09562/selftest_report.json)
- [Bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1806.09562/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1806.09562/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)

The placebo arm was not run because the protocol requires stopping after the hinted arm breaks the family a second time.
